    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>奇物，极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>着装这顶骷髅形状的头盔期间，你获得对寒冷、毒素和暗蚀伤害的抗性。</p><p>此外，着装头盔期间，你可以用头盔施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.6vnUcrrwP7bygCfX]{死神灵魄 Spirit of Death}</em>（见第7章），而无需任何材料成分。此法术一经头盔施放，直到下次黎明前不能再次以此法施放该法术。</p><p>While wearing this skull-shaped helm, you have resistance to cold, poison, and necrotic damage.</p><p>Additionally, while wearing the helm, you can cast @spell[Spirit of Death|BMT] from it without requiring material components. Once you use the helm to cast the spell, the helm can't cast this spell again until the next dawn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
